Output docs/assets/clips/answer-questions.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Padding 10
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type `exec "$KDEMO_DIR/env.sh" herdr`
Enter
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+B
Type "b"
Sleep 300ms
Ctrl+B
Type "h"
Sleep 500ms
Show

# The inbox: the cursor starts on the recommended option.
Sleep 1.5s
Type "i"
Sleep 2.5s
Tab
Sleep 400ms
Type "Keep the chosen range in the URL so a search can be shared."
Sleep 900ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Escape

# The answer reaches the task as a message from you, and it goes on working.
Sleep 8s
